OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGet set, ready, go! Great North
OL,4,ARun under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 13.1-mile (21km) event sees runners
OL,7,Fand wheelchair users race from
OL,8,FNewcastle through Gateshead and South
OL,9,FTyneside, before finishing in South
OL,10,FShields.
OL,12,FThe elite women's and wheelchair
OL,13,Fathlete races set off first followed by
OL,14,Fthe men's elite and the masses.
